*** Join the Copter-Commanders...

We get very little feedback about what is and is not fun, that only
comes from users like you.  The best place to talk about
copter-commander is the forum on sf.net:
http://sourceforge.net/forum/forum.php?forum_id=70834 (not that anyone
knows about it at time of writing - you may be the first!)
