*** IF YOU GET STUCK

Trouble compiling or whatever? email
coco-devel@lists.sourceforge.net .  Unfortunately, spam is a problem,
so I think you might have to join the list before you can post: 
http://lists.sourceforge.net/lists/listinfo/coco-devel
